StyleBox[\"denominators\", \"TI\"]\)_List\)],\!\(\*\n\
StyleBox[\"loopmomenta\", \"TI\"]\)_List] determines a basis.\nFirst argument \
is a name of the basis.\nSecond argument is a complete set of independent \
denominators. Shortcuts are allowed here: for the massless propagator sp[l,l] \
