involving loop momenta,\\n    LMs[myMission3] \[LongDash] loop momenta,\\n    \
EMs[myMission3] \[LongDash] external momenta,\\n    Parameters[myMission3] \
\[LongDash] parameters (invariants, masses, dimension),\\n    Toj[myMission3] \
\[LongDash] rules to transform scalar products to denominators,\\n    \
CutDs[myMission3] \[LongDash] flag vector of cut denominators.\"\>"], "Print",\

