\[LongDash] denominators,\\n    SPs[myMission5] \[LongDash] scalar products \
involving loop momenta,\\n    LMs[myMission5] \[LongDash] loop momenta,\\n    \
EMs[myMission5] \[LongDash] external momenta,\\n    Parameters[myMission5] \
\[LongDash] parameters (invariants, masses, dimension),\\n    Toj[myMission5] \
\[LongDash] rules to transform scalar products to denominators,\\n    \
CutDs[myMission5] \[LongDash] flag vector of cut denominators.\"\>"], "Print",\

