Cell[BoxData["\<\"myMissionMassive is valid basis. The definitions of the \
basis will be saved in \\\"Bases/myMissionMassive\\\" directory.\\n    \
Ds[myMissionMassive] \[LongDash] denominators,\\n    SPs[myMissionMassive] \
\[LongDash] scalar products involving loop momenta,\\n    \
LMs[myMissionMassive] \[LongDash] loop momenta,\\n    EMs[myMissionMassive] \
\[LongDash] external momenta,\\n    Parameters[myMissionMassive] \[LongDash] \
parameters (invariants, masses, dimension),\\n    Toj[myMissionMassive] \
\[LongDash] rules to transform scalar products to denominators,\\n    \
CutDs[myMissionMassive] \[LongDash] flag vector of cut denominators.\"\>"], \
"Print",
